  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.2 stable: version-sync with SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.2.2 stable. No source changes in WebTorrent.Server itself - the WebTorrent 3.2.2 SCTP backpressure improvements and SpawnDev.RTC 1.1.8 stable dep flow through transitively. See SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.2.2 release notes for the details (shared-TCS multi-awaiter SCTP backpressure, polling-based wait that closes 100MB regression, duplicate-handshake hardening, RTC 1.1.8 stable bump). Consumers running WebTorrent.Server should bump alongside their WebTorrent client.",
